<title>UK: Pizza Hut to create 5,000 jobs in UK.</title>
<headline>Pizza Hut to create 5,000 jobs in UK.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pizza Hut, the U.S. based restaurant chain, said on Wednesday that it will employ 5,000 new members of staff in Britain over the next four years and expand to 500 outlets from 350.</p>
<p>Pizza Hut in the UK is jointly owned by U.S.-based PepsiCo, developer of the pizza chain, and Whitbread Plc, the British brewing and leisure group.</p>
